3. Paste your Slack / Teams / Discord Incoming Webhook URL in **Send Alert to Slack / Webhook**." } , "id" : "a1000001-0001-4000-8000-000000000010" , "name" : "Sticky Note — Setup Guide" , "type" : "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote" , "typeVersion" : 1 , "position" : [ 140 , 40 ] } , { "parameters" : { "width" : 680 , "height" : 170 , "color" : 4 , "content" : "## ⚙️ Branching, Budget Cap & Output
